{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03230","headline":"早发大庾岭 · 宋之问","name":"早发大庾岭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨跻大庾险，驿鞍驰复息。\n雾露昼未开，浩途不可测。\n嵥起华夷界，信爲造化力。\n歇鞍问徒旅，乡关在西北。\n出门怨别家，登岭恨辞国。\n自惟勖忠孝，斯罪懵所得。\n皇明颇照洗，延议日纷惑。\n兄弟远沦居，妻子成异域。\n羽翮伤已毁，童幼怜未识。\n踌蹰恋北顾，亭午曦霁色。\n春煖阴梅花，瘴回阳鸟翼。\n含沙缘涧聚，吻草依林植。\n适蛮悲疾首，怀巩泪沾臆。\n感谢鵷鹭朝，勤修魑魅职。\n生还倘非远，誓拟酬恩德。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}